OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly member interviewed by
OL,4,Apolice over Drumcree protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Northern Ireland Assembly member has
OL,7,Fbeen interviewed by police
OL,8,Finvestigating protests over the
OL,9,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,11,FPeople Before Profit's Gerry Carroll
OL,12,Fwas among several politicians asked to
OL,13,Fattend interviews over their
OL,14,Finvolvement in the demonstrations on
OL,15,FGarvaghy Road in Portadown, County
OL,16,FArmagh.
OL,18,FThe protests were part of a 13-day
OL,19,Fstand-off which blocked a contentious
OL,20,FOrange Order march from passing along
OL,21,Fthe mainly nationalist street.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
